<div class="contact-grid"><article><h2>Something isn’t working?</h2><p>It helps to include:</p><ul><li>Your Music Mirror and iOS / iPadOS versions.</li><li>What you were trying to do.</li><li>What happened, and what you expected.</li><li>Steps that make it happen again, if you know them.</li></ul><p>You don’t need to send a child’s name, face, score photos or recordings. Describe the problem in words first.</p></article><article><h2>Have an idea?</h2><p>Tell us which part of practice feels difficult and what you wish you could do. A small, specific example is helpful.</p><h2>Looking for a quick answer?</h2><p><a href="/music-mirror/get-started/">Set up your first practice →</a></p><p><a href="/music-mirror/faq/">Browse common questions →</a></p><p><a href="/music-mirror/privacy.html">Read the privacy policy →</a></p></article></div>
